# ITS Smart Card Management System - Complete Project Overview

## 📌 Project Summary
This is a comprehensive **Smart Card Management System** (ITS Smart Card) - a full-featured web application for managing card lifecycle including card applications, upgrades, lost card tracking, quality control, dispatch, and delivery. It serves as an administrative portal for card management operations.

---

## 🛠 Tech Stack

### Frontend Core
- **React 18** - UI Framework
- **React Router DOM v7** - Client-side routing
- **Vite v6** - Build tool and development server
- **JavaScript (ES6+)** - Programming language

### UI & Styling
- **Tailwind CSS v3** - Utility-first CSS framework
- **Shadcn UI / Radix UI** - Component library (40+ accessible components)
- **Framer Motion** - Animation library
- **Lucide React** - Icon library

### State & Data Management
- **React Context** - Global state management
- **Axios** - HTTP client for API calls

### Form & Validation
- **React Hook Form** - Form handling
- **Zod** - Schema validation

### Testing
- **Jest** - Unit testing framework
- **React Testing Library** - Component testing

### Maps & Location
- **@googlemaps/js-api-loader** - Google Maps integration

### Utilities
- **date-fns** - Date manipulation
- **jszip** - ZIP file handling
- **crypto-js** - Encryption utilities
- **jwt-decode** - JWT token handling
- **react-hot-toast** - Toast notifications

### DevOps & CI/CD
- **GitLab CI/CD** - Automated pipeline
- **Docker** - Containerization
- **SonarQube** - Code quality analysis
- **Trivy** - Security vulnerability scanning

