## 🎯 Key Features & Modules

### 1. Dashboard (/dashboard)
- Real-time card status tracking with visual workflow icons
- Multiple card types: Upgrade, Lost Card, New Card, Upgrade Card
- Status tracking from initiation to completion (15+ status stages)
- Admin and user search functionality
- Delivery management modal

### 2. Card Management
- Apply New Card (/apply-new-card) - New card application processing
- Upgrade ITS Card (/upgrade-its-card) - Card upgrade requests
- Add New Card (/user-cards/add-new-card) - Manual card entry
- Users Card (/upgrade-its-card) - Card listing and management

### 3. Card Workflow Stages
- Initiate → Acknowledge → Ready For Download → Download → Receive → Check
- Ready For Print → Production Done → QC and Analysis → Dispatch
- Dispatch Acknowledge → Assign For Delivery → Delivery → Card Acknowledge → Complete

### 4. Import/Print Module (/import-print)
- Import print functionality
- Error list management
- Bulk upload capability
- Error editing and resolution

### 5. Export/Print Module (/export-print)
- Card export functionality
- Archive management for printed cards

### 6. Card Inventory (/inventory-list)
- Inventory management
- Bulk upload for inventory
- Edit inventory entries

### 7. Card Quality Check (/card-quality-check)
- Quality control workflow
- Card viewing and inspection

### 8. Card Dispatch (/card-dispatch)
- Cards Dispatch (/card-dispatch) - Dispatch management
- Dispatch to Jamaats (/manage-dispatch) - Distribution to local branches
- Dispatch to Courier (/dispatch-courier) - Courier dispatch
- Card Tracking (/card-tracking) - Real-time tracking

### 9. Lost Card Management (/lost-card-review)
- Lost card application processing
- Admin review portal
- Lost card workflow tracking

### 10. Reports & Analytics
- Payment Reports (/payment-report) - Payment tracking
- Cards Report (/cards-report) - Card statistics
- Missing Reports (/missing-reports) - Missing card reports
- Reconciliation Report (/reconciliation-report) - Financial reconciliation

### 11. User Management
- Assign Role (/assign-role) - Role-based access control
- Family member management
- User profile management

### 12. Authentication & Security
- Login/Logout functionality
- JWT-based authentication
- Protected routes
- Role-based permissions

### 13. Additional Features
- Theme Support - Light/dark mode toggle
- Responsive Design - Mobile-friendly interface
- File Upload - Document/image uploads
- Data Tables - Advanced table with pagination, sorting, filtering
- Export - Data export capabilities
- Payment Gateway Integration - Online payment processing

